#. module: atmta_procurement_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_receipt/models/vendor_bill.py:0
msgid ""
"  %(product)s — this bill adds %(adding)s, billed in total %(billed)s, "
"accepted on site %(received)s"
msgstr ""
"  %(product)s — هذه الفاتورة تضيف %(adding)s، وإجمالي المفوتر %(billed)s، "
"والمقبول في الموقع %(received)s"

#. module: atmta_procurement_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_receipt/models/vendor_bill.py:0
msgid ""
"%(move)s bills for more than this site accepted:\n"
"\n"
"%(details)s\n"
"\n"
"Receive and inspect the rest before billing it, or ask the vendor for a corrected invoice. Material that was rejected is not billable, and posting this would put the difference into the ledger where somebody has to reverse it."
msgstr ""
"%(move)s تفوتر أكثر مما قبله الموقع:\n"
"\n"
"%(details)s\n"
"\n"
"استلم وافحص الباقي قبل فوترته، أو اطلب من المورد فاتورة مصححة. المواد المرفوضة غير قابلة للفوترة، وترحيل هذه الفاتورة سيُدخل الفرق في دفتر الأستاذ حيث سيضطر أحد إلى عكسه."

#. module: atmta_procurement_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_receipt/models/receipt_inspection.py:0
msgid "%(name)s is already %(state)s."
msgstr "%(name)s بالفعل في حالة %(state)s."

#. module: atmta_procurement_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_receipt/models/receipt_inspection.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s rejects %(items)s with no finding recorded against them. What was "
"wrong with an item is the one thing its line has to say."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s يرفض %(items)s دون تسجيل أي ملاحظة عليها. سبب الخلل في البند هو "
"الشيء الوحيد الذي يجب أن يذكره بنده."

#. module: atmta_procurement_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_receipt/models/stock_picking.py:0
msgid ""
"%(picking)s delivers material to %(project)s, which requires inspection before a receipt is validated.\n"
"\n"
"Open the inspection, record what arrived and what of it is fit to use, then validate. Rejecting material here is not a judgement about the vendor — it is a statement about this load."
msgstr ""
"%(picking)s يسلم مواد إلى %(project)s، الذي يتطلب الفحص قبل اعتماد الاستلام.\n"
"\n"
"افتح الفحص، وسجل ما وصل وما يصلح منه للاستخدام، ثم اعتمد. رفض المواد هنا ليس حكمًا على المورد — بل هو إفادة عن هذه الشحنة."

#. module: atmta_procurement_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_receipt/models/stock_picking.py:0
msgid ""
"%(picking)s was inspected and nothing on it was accepted.\n"
"\n"
"Validating would book rejected material into stock. Cancel the receipt, or arrange the return with the vendor — either way it is a decision somebody makes, not one this screen makes for them."
msgstr ""
"تم فحص %(picking)s ولم يُقبل أي شيء منه.\n"
"\n"
"الاعتماد سيُدخل مواد مرفوضة إلى المخزون. ألغِ الاستلام، أو رتب الإرجاع مع المورد — وفي الحالتين هو قرار يتخذه شخص ما، وليس قرارًا تتخذه هذه الشاشة نيابة عنه."

#. module: atmta_procurement_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_receipt/models/receipt_inspection.py:0
msgid ""
"%(product)s: %(accepted)s accepted against %(received)s delivered. Accepting"
" more than arrived puts stock into the system that nobody delivered."
msgstr ""
"%(product)s: تم قبول %(accepted)s مقابل تسليم %(received)s. قبول كمية أكبر "
"مما وصل يُدخل إلى النظام مخزونًا لم يسلمه أحد."

#. module: atmta_procurement_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_receipt/models/evaluation_audit_receipt.py:0
msgid "%d confirmed tender line(s) carry a project and no cost code."
msgstr "%d من بنود المناقصة المؤكدة تحمل مشروعًا دون رمز تكلفة."

#. module: atmta_procurement_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_receipt/models/evaluation_audit_receipt.py:0
msgid ""
"%d inspection(s) rejected material that the stock ledger shows as received."
msgstr "%d من عمليات الفحص رفضت موادًا يظهرها سجل المخزون كمستلمة."

#. module: atmta_procurement_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_receipt/models/evaluation_audit_receipt.py:0
msgid "%d purchase line(s) are billed for more than the site accepted."
msgstr "%d من بنود الشراء مفوترة بأكثر مما قبله الموقع."

#. module: atmta_procurement_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_receipt/models/evaluation_audit_receipt.py:0
msgid ""
"%d receipt(s) were validated with no inspection on a project that now "
"requires one."
msgstr "%d من الاستلامات اعتُمدت دون فحص في مشروع يتطلبه الآن."

#. module: atmta_procurement_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_receipt/models/receipt_inspection.py:0
msgid ""
"%s has already been recorded. An inspection result is not withdrawn; a re-"
"inspection is a new receipt."
msgstr ""
"تم تسجيل %s بالفعل. لا تُسحب نتيجة الفحص؛ وإعادة الفحص تكون باستلام جديد."

#. module: atmta_procurement_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_receipt/models/receipt_inspection.py:0
msgid "%s inspects nothing. An empty sheet is not a pass."
msgstr "%s لا يفحص شيئًا. الورقة الفارغة لا تعني النجاح."

#. module: atmta_procurement_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_receipt/models/receipt_inspection.py:0
msgid ""
"%s rejects material without saying why. The vendor is entitled to the "
"reason, and so is whoever settles the dispute."
msgstr ""
"%s يرفض مواد دون ذكر السبب. من حق المورد معرفة السبب، وكذلك من يسوي النزاع."

#. module: atmta_procurement_receipt
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:atmta_procurement_receipt.constraint_realestate_procurement_receipt_inspection_picking_uniq
msgid ""
"A receipt has one inspection. Record the outcome on the existing one rather "
